      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "O B LEGAL NZ (7) recorded another strong performance last start when he battled on bravely to finish second over 2138m at Albion Park. Can travel in a nice spot from this draw and wait on the sprint lane if necessary. Won't find this any harder and he can go one better. ROCK NIEN (2) has been thereabouts and again performed admirably at the most recent appearance, making up plenty of ground in a long sustained run but finding a couple better over 1660m at Albion Park. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Good enough to win a race of this calibre. GLENLEDI BOY NZ (1) is looming as a real threat after a better effort last start, finishing second at Albion Park over 1660m. GREAT ACHIEVER (8) is worth some thought despite his last-start sixth over 1780m at this track on November 5.",
